Modifications (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Derived from upstream commit ab01b63. Modified in 2026 by MSW Lab AI to port the
8B prefill path to Apple M3 Ultra (80-core GPU). Every upstream kernel is retained
and remains selectable at runtime; no upstream kernel was deleted or altered.

Modified files:

  unified_8b_kernels.metal
      ADDED simdgroup_matrix kernels: flash_attn_sg_causal_d128,
      flash_attn_sg_q8_0_causal_d128, sg_gemm_q4_0, sg_gemm_q4_0_fused_swiglu,
      sg_qkv_head_gemm_q4_0, plus tile-sweep variants retained for reproducibility.
      All pre-existing kernels are byte-for-byte unchanged.

  bench_8b_engine.mm
      ADDED runtime kernel selection via the M3_SG_ATTN and M3_SG_GEMM environment
      variables, and the dispatch geometry (threadgroup size, threadgroup memory,
      grid) each selection requires. Setting both to 0 restores the upstream
      behaviour exactly, including its measured baseline timings.

  README.md
      APPENDED the section "M3 Ultra Support & Tuning Notes". No upstream text
      was changed or removed.

New files authored by MSW Lab AI:

  attn_sg_bench.mm        isolated attention A/B harness + CPU FP32 reference
  mlp_bench.mm            isolated MLP A/B harness (fused/unfused, scalar/simdgroup)
  sgprobe.mm              MSL simdgroup_matrix capability probe
  M3_ULTRA_FINDINGS.md    per-phase measurements, negative results, written summary
  NOTICE                  this file

All other files are unmodified from upstream.
